{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_swllow_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_swllow_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"殊途","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_swllow_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"dc46eb8888b8f8b5bc52aede7fc4013cc07a780df9e3a5d7fb3b259907c8715d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"一名天灾信使为停泊的罗德岛带来了天灾即将在三到五日内降临的消息。可在那之后，他找到灰喉，向灰喉提出了令她意想不到的邀约。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，“灰喉”......他们现在是这么叫你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。你是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......你是真的认不出我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信使先生，天灾的消息是你带来的。虽然没那么急迫，但我想我们也没那么多时间相互打哑谜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"也对，毕竟这么多年过去了，你当时又还小......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"给，这是当年我和你父母一起拍的照片。这下能想起来了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"照片上，眼前的男人就和我现在差不多大，正略显拘谨地叉着手，站在爸爸和妈妈身边。右下角附着日期，那时我刚过完八岁生日不久。\n照片背面写着“赠伊恩·卡德维尔”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊恩·卡德维尔......爸爸的学生。我有印象，你有段时间好像经常来我家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你变了好多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我该怎么称呼你？是灰喉，还是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那，灰喉，我这次不光是来预警天灾的，还有一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我想请你做我的护卫，天灾信使护卫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离开罗德岛，做你的......天灾信使护卫？这不现实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，就算你是爸爸的学生，这么多年过去，为什么你现在才找到罗德岛、找到我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在几个月前那场天灾发生时才见到你的，发生在莱塔尼亚北部的冬灵山脉的那一场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沃伦姆德？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，那场重创了沃伦姆德的天灾。在你带领的罗德岛小队的控制之下，事态才没有发展到最坏的那一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜我看到你的时候，你们在撤离，而我在往事发地赶去，虽然觉得你眼熟，可我没有空余时间去确认那是不是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之后，通过一些天灾信使内部的消息网络，我最终确定了那就是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这又和让我做你的护卫有什么关系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你小时候可没这么多疑。你这些年在罗德岛上......过得真的好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你的母亲......在那场夺走了老师生命的动乱过后，我还遇见过她。她当时正在四处寻找一个能托付你的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她找过你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我找的她。我主动提出想资助你们一段时间，不过被拒绝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她拒绝了你？为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"也许是因为我那时过得也很不好，只够自己糊口吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你父母对我很好，还让我在你家借住过一段时间。所以，对这件事，我一直耿耿于怀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......我看见过你和感染者打交道时的状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"在沃伦姆德城外的冬灵山脉附近，你救助了一个感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"这种事对罗德岛来说应该只是举手之劳，可你在帮助那个感染者的时候——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你在和客人聊天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快聊完了。怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"这位是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，罗德岛精英干员。煌，这位是伊恩，我父亲的学生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"煌大大咧咧地凑了过来，靠在墙边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"根据我们这边的测算，天灾会在三到五天内侵袭这片地区，不过我还会在附近停留一两天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你打定主意了，就来找我吧。我就在罗德岛停泊位置偏北一点点的镇子里借住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉打扰你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起来一点都不抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"别总是冷着一张脸嘛。你还年轻，多做点表情不会长皱纹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以你到底有什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"明天晚上甲板上会举行一场派对。要不要跟我一起去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"真少见。你犹豫了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你会像前几次一样直截了当地说“我不和你一起参加活动”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后在派对开始前五分钟被你拖过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"看，你这不是很懂嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，你之所以犹豫......是决定答应那个伊恩的邀约？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，事先声明，我也是来找你的时候碰巧在门外听到的，没有偷听的意思。抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"这次我看起来比较抱歉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"认真地说，你觉得那位伊恩的邀约怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不可能答应他，不过也确实该去找他谈谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛什么时候起航？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"既然天灾预警是未来三到五天风险最高，我想，大概二十四小时内就要开动了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你放心，时间来得及。就算你和那位信使先生聊过了头，我也会为了给你争取时间，下到动力区，骗锅炉工大哥喝两杯的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉，你来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"喝点什么吗？镇上的人正在准备撤离，东西都卖得很便宜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不必。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想先把我母亲的事聊完。她有没有留下什么东西，或者......你做信使的这段时间里，取得过和她相关的线索吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......很遗憾，没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我试着寻找过你母亲的下落，最终一无所获。不过，假如你愿意来做我的护卫，两个人查起来的效率总比一个人要高些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我理解你作为信使需要一名护卫。你的护卫也许辞职了，也许去世了，不管怎么样，总之，你现在迫切需要一名新的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可为什么是我？就因为在沃伦姆德的那场救援吗？还是说，只是因为你想完成过去没能完成的心愿——“帮我一把”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你非要这么说的话，的确，我想帮你一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"记得我在罗德岛上没说完的那些话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你在冬灵山脉帮助那个感染者的时候，双手抖得厉害，全身上下都在向外传递着......恐惧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那时我就知道，你和我......是一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么我明明是你父亲的学徒，现在却成了天灾信使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"因为那场夺走你父亲生命的动乱......不仅让我失去了恩师，也让我失去了数位亲人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"从此以后，当我手术刀下的肉体上出现源石结晶，我就会感到反胃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"当我想起药瓶里存着的是抑制矿石病的药物，我就会不由自主地想，与其在这种不治之症上投入资源，不如关心那些尚有希望的病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那位煌干员和你的关系应该还不错，对吗？可她靠在墙边的时候，你在不由自主地远离她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是一种下意识的反应罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉，看得出，这些年你在罗德岛上过得很......压抑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是希望你能到一个更适合自己的环境里去......别像现在这样勉强自己。你明明可以从一开始就避开的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是罗德岛抚养我长大的，伊恩。因为这样的理由弃感染者而去，这是忘恩负义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你只是换了一种方式帮助他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"协助人们躲避天灾，从一开始就掐灭感染的源头，这同样是对他们的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的确抚养了你，但你事事听从他们的命令，这不是报恩，这是盲从。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盲从？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者的生命所剩无几，他们必须紧紧抓住某种信条、某种希望，无论那是让他们无私奉献的，还是让他们化为暴徒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们不是，所以我们不该盲从，更不应该一直让自己活在不得不厌恶和恐惧他人的环境之中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一些并不算久远的记忆从我的脑海中浮现出来。\n在我将那些记忆编织成话语之前，窗外突然传来喧嚣声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来似乎是......撤离过程中起了什么纠纷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛干员的责任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是我应该这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"（耸肩）我也去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出什么事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊恐的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"树林那边......那边......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾云？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊恐的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信使先生，该不会天灾马上就要来了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"别慌，距离还很远。我手头有便携式仪器，稍等......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾降临的时间提前了。预警从三到五天修改为六到十二小时之后抵达。形式不变，还是风暴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊恐的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"抓紧时间撤离。不重要的和过于笨重的东西就放手吧，生命高于一切。你们之前联系车队了吗？现在还能联系上吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊恐的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车队联系不上，但驮兽车家家户户都有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那就别管车队了，先用驮兽车离开这片区域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊恐的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！多谢您，信使先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉，这边能和罗德岛取得联系吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没问题。我已经以短讯形式把消息发回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜......妈妈......爸爸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，那个孩子怎么站在镇子中央一直哭，身边连个大人都没有？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，你怎么了？为什么一直哭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜......呜呜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，冷静一点，你家里的大人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜，爸爸和妈妈，他们......他们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我不敢回去，哇啊啊啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，这孩子是怎么回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这不是树林里的感染者孩子吗？怎么跑这儿来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，天灾云马上就到头顶了，家里人也不管管。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"听见“感染者孩子”几个字，我和伊恩同时往后退了一步。\n孩子哭得更大声了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"树林里......是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"镇子里的感染者会被驱逐到树林里生活，一种相对温和的感染者应对方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那树林里的人们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前已经拜托其他人通知他们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"这种时候，人是会自己动起来的。树林里的感染者也看得到天灾云，就算没有确切的预报，他们也不会觉得天灾是几天后的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他们并不知道天灾会在半天之内抵达。如果他们晚了几个小时......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我上前一步，重新回到恐慌的孩子身旁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友，你......家里的大人现在在做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈卧床了......爸爸在给她找草药......呜呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们有通讯装置吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯......装置？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这样的东西，会发出响声，能和附近的人说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？我现在很忙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个孩子的父母......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没空管！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾的预警是六到十二小时，您还有时间！这个孩子的母亲卧床，父亲在给母亲找草药。能请您去通知一下他们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_626_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前说是三五天，现在又说是六到十二小时，我怎么知道我进去之后会不会一头闯进天灾里！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......伊恩，我们必须得通知树林里的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"这附近的源石已经处在活性化的过程中，任何朝天灾中心靠近的行为，都在增加你自己暴露在活性源石粉尘中的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"没有阻断剂，也没有防护设备，让健康人朝着天灾的方向走去，简直就是谋杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"再说......反正是感染者，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊恩，你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂？煌，有空吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，我在北边的镇子里。树林里还有一批感染者不知道天灾来袭的确切时间。我需要阻断剂和防护设备，要快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？用不用灌醉管锅炉的大叔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要不耽误时间，随你的便。完毕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不相信煌会来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你和罗德岛上的人打交道的时间比我长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我也承认感染者中会出现一些道德高尚的人，但那只是因为他们本就高尚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"可感染者......作为一个群体，他们是一只脚迈进了死亡的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"绝望是他们的底色，作为一个群体，他们只会为了生存......更加暴力，更加卑劣，更加难测。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你选择......退后，你不再和任何一个感染者打交道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，我选择退后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"即使不和任何一个感染者打交道，我也能做到很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我能让许多人免于因天灾失去生命，能让健康人免于在天灾中沦为感染者，这就是我的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“为了更多的生命”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你也听过这句格言。在沃伦姆德吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，要做危机合约的信使，我还不够格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很庆幸你还不够格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我的确不赞同其中一些人的行为，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，为了更多的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者的生命呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"是生命，但是......是已经受害、行将枯萎的生命，是更短、更危险，因此必须被排在健康人之后的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好别让煌听见这些话......不，你最好别让我再听见这些话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚刚说，“盲从”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一段时间以前，也有人跟我这么说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"只听从命令，一昧依赖别人的想法行动，最后会变成可怕的模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"多数人只是盲从，他们会退缩，也会颤抖。他们并不真依赖谁，他们只是没有开始思考。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......而那些没有自己方向的人，只是种索求愿望来获得成就感和存在感的机器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"开动，不断运作，投入愿望，实现愿望，把周围一切都吃掉，把许愿的人也吃掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你经历的还不够多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊恩，那个人也是个感染者。他甚至不属于罗德岛，他是罗德岛的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道当时我是不是在盲从，但至少现在......不是。我清楚地知道我在做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在罗德岛上度过了许多年，一路磕磕绊绊。但无论如何，现在，罗德岛上有我的朋友，有我重视的人，里面有普通人，也有感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊恩，你不也在从感染者身边逃开吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚得知那个孩子是感染者的时候，煌走进我们聊天的房间的时候......你表现得比我更为恐惧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我们过去是一样的，但现在，不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少我并未活在对别人的恐惧和厌恶之中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阻断剂、防护设备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"都备好了。这位先生需要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。他不会进去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，还有什么要跟这位先生说的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊恩，如果我从树林里出来的时候变成了感染者......你还会想让我做你的护卫吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你不该拿这种事开玩笑。害怕是无法伪装的，你的声音颤抖得厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，我怕得要死，但我并不恐惧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊恩，现在轮到你回答我的问题了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不会。如果你变成了感染者，我不会再希望你来做我的护卫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道这样听起来很无情，但......我对感染者整体的态度，不会变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使你从来没有真正和任何一个感染者认真聊过一次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，看来我们也不用再多说什么了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天灾信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛......把你教得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"avg_367_swllow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会把这当成褒奖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉，等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","aliases":["浮士德"]}]}
